<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in the <a href="https://asuengineeringonline.com/">online graduate programs</a> offered through the Ira A. Fulton Schools of Engineering at Arizona State University. We received your inquiry about our graduate engineering offerings, specifically the <a href="https://asuengineeringonline.com/online-degrees/master-engineering-meng">Master of Engineering</a>. Our <a href="https://asuengineeringonline.com/online-degrees/master-engineering-systems-engineering-meng">systems engineering</a> program was designed with input from global corporations and targets professionals leading major complex systems development or programs at their companies. The key to this program is the amalgamation of several professional association and certificate programs such as INCOSE, CMII and PMI.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Our programs are intended to be online programs aimed at working professionals who require the convenience and flexibility provided by our online offerings. We do not have a requirement for students to attend campus; you can go through the whole program without ever setting foot in Tempe, Arizona. Of course, we encourage all of our students to join us for graduation to celebrate your accomplishment but even then it is not required.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Many of our working professional students take one to two courses per semester, on average. Students can complete the program as quickly as two years, on average approximately three years, but must be completed within six years. In order to stay active in the program, and abide by the Graduate College guidelines, students must be enrolled each fall and spring semester. We offer courses each fall, spring and summer semesters. Fall and spring are the traditional semester length (15 weeks) while summer sessions are more condensed (6 or 8 weeks).</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Students admitted to one of our online programs are assessed online tuition. &nbsp;The program requires 10 courses and we encourage students to budget around $30,000 USD for tuition and fees. &nbsp;You can get the most up-to-date tuition information, including a breakdown on the cost per course, on <a href="http://asuengineeringonline.com/tuition">this useful page</a> on our site.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">We are currently accepting applications for the upcoming semester. You can review the admission application process and begin your application <a href="http://graduate.asu.edu/admissions/how_to_apply">here</a>.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Sincerely,<br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Angela Harguess<br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Global &nbsp;Outreach &amp; Exteneded Education</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Ira A. Fulton Schools of Engineering</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">p: 480-965-1878 | f: 480-965-2929 | <a href="https://asuengineeringonline.com/">ASUEngineeringOnline.com</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><i>If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</i></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font color="#ffffff" face="arial">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>